            "short_description": "Welcome to Flying Turkey!!! In here, You must defend the platform and stop turkeys getting away. Have you ever try to use an ice cream to strike turkeys away? Or use a frog-glove to launch turkeys? There is a great variety of turkeys and weapons waiting for you to explore. Just have a blast!!!",
